Experience: 4 years
Top skills: React, TypeScript
Job types: Fulltime
Needs visa sponsorship: no
Work style: Remote
Short-term goal: Lead a small frontend team
</user_profile>

# Saved memories
<user_memories>
[a1b2c3d4] (preference) Avoid crypto companies
</user_memories>

# Earlier in this conversation
<session_summary>
Talked about React jobs.
</session_summary>",
